  "description": {
    "en": "A quiet dot under the conversation header that unfolds into the Chinese solar term, its 候, a 养生 line, the year table and the 消息卦 of the month. Drag the card itself. The 卦 page can cast a hexagram with three coins.",
    "zh": "对话区标题栏下沿的一颗小圆点，展开是今天的节气、三候、一句养生、全年交节时刻与月建消息卦；整张卡片都能拖着走。 卦页还能铜钱摇一卦。"
  },
